          "So $\\cos\\theta=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{3}}{(2)(2)}=\\dfrac{2\\sqrt{3}}{4}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$.",
          "Therefore $\\theta=\\cos^{-1}\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$."
